# Contrasting Assessments of Interdisciplinarity in Emerging Specialties: The Case of Neural Networks Research.

**Authors:** McCain, Katherine W., Whitney, P. Joy

## Abstract
Discussion of bibliometric analysis of interdisciplinary research in emerging fields focuses on a study of neural networks research that examined citation analyses, publishing patterns and subject terms, and journal subject classification. Roles that journals can play in interdisciplinary information transfer are considered. (Contains 42 references.) (LRW)

